From 248e991b6157618cf7715500358729ea9dccb23c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:05:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] nvk: opt in to one conservative GM107 fragment UBO cbuf

Preserve upstream slots, exclude robust2 and unknown indexing, separate compiler cache identity, and test real NIR lowering and full SM50 compilation.
---
 docs/drivers/nvk.rst                          |  20 ++
 src/nouveau/vulkan/meson.build                |   2 +
 src/nouveau/vulkan/nvk_debug.h                |   1 +
 src/nouveau/vulkan/nvk_instance.c             |   1 +
 .../vulkan/nvk_nir_lower_descriptors.c        |  20 +-
 src/nouveau/vulkan/nvk_physical_device.h      |   8 +
 src/nouveau/vulkan/nvk_shader.c               |   3 +-
 src/nouveau/vulkan/test_nvk_gm107_ubo.c       | 213 ++++++++++++++++++
 8 files changed, 263 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/nouveau/vulkan/test_nvk_gm107_ubo.c

diff --git a/docs/drivers/nvk.rst b/docs/drivers/nvk.rst
index 21475984..2ea4238a 100644
--- a/docs/drivers/nvk.rst
+++ b/docs/drivers/nvk.rst
@@ -103,3 +103,23 @@ Developer info
    :glob:
 
    nvk/*
+
+Experimental GM107 UBO policy
+----------------------------
+
+``NVK_DEBUG=gm107_ubo_diag`` logs JSON compile observations for GM107 fragment
+shaders, prefixed by ``NVK_GM107_UBO``. Rejection masks are 1 (descriptor type),
+2 (dynamic byte offset), and 4 (range). Cached binaries are reported as cache
+hits, not compiler coverage. Buffer contents are not logged. Compilation is
+not evidence of shader execution or hotness.
+
+``NVK_DEBUG=gm107_ubo_cbuf`` opts into appending at most one ordinary UBO cbuf
+on GM107 fragment shaders, after all upstream bindings. It requires at least
+eight static loads and constant descriptor/byte offsets within the constant
+window. Unknown indexing, robustBufferAccess2, indirect shader binding and
+``no_cbuf`` disable promotion. Existing binding commands and barriers are
+unchanged. Indirect binding overhead may exceed shader savings.
+
+Both flags participate in compiler cache identity. Use separate warmed cache
+directories for timings and disable the disk shader cache only for diagnostic
+runs. No performance improvement on hardware has been demonstrated.
